`js_utflen` is in `crate::jsstring`; `js_strtod` in `crate::jsdtoa`;\n  `jsV_newobject` in `crate::jsproperty`; `js_malloc/js_free/js_strdup/\n  js_pushobject/js_push*/js_pop/js_copy/js_rot2/js_call/js_getproperty/\n  js_defproperty/js_tovalue/js_isobject/js_isprimitive/js_iscallable/\n  js_toobject/js_isstring/js_tostring/js_tonumber/js_toprimitive/js_throw/\n  js_endtry/jsV_newmemstring` in `crate::jsrun`.\n- `soffsetof(js_Value, t.type)` is 15.\n- `js_newstring`'s `jsV_newstring` uses `obj->u.s.shrstr` (a `[c_char;16]`\n  inside the union) and compares `obj->u.s.string != obj->u.s.shrstr`; use\n  `(*obj).u.s.shrstr.as_mut_ptr()`.\n\nSTEP 3 — Verify: run\n`cargo build --release 2>&1 | grep -E \"jsvalue\\.rs\" | head -60`\nand fix every error attributable to src/jsvalue.rs. Errors in other modules\n(not written yet) are expected.\n\nSTEP 4 — Report the no_mangle symbols defined, line count, and remaining errors."}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1044,"cache_read_input_tokens":228207,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1044,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e867ece2-5670-426a-953e-de496239b763","uuid":"4e729ab4-96b6-430d-be56-7a535d2d23c9","timestamp":"2026-08-22T15:10:10.615Z"}
