et: it aborts at name-resolution (E0583 for the ~20 unwritten modules plus E0425 in `jsrun.rs`), 90 errors total, so a grep for `jsintern.rs` returns nothing either way — a false clean.\n\nTo get real coverage I built a throwaway crate in `$TMPDIR` (since deleted) containing the real `cstd.rs`, `jsi.rs`, `macros.rs` and `jsintern.rs` plus minimal `jsrun`/`jserror` stubs, pinned to edition 2021 to match `Cargo.toml`. That compiles with **zero errors and zero warnings attributable to `jsintern.rs`**, and `nm` on the resulting rlib confirms all six `T` symbols. Note the edition matters here: under the default edition 2024 the same code raises `unsafe_op_in_unsafe_fn` as a hard error, so the file relies on the crate's 2021 setting (consistent with `jsrun.rs`/`jserror.rs`).\n\nNo remaining errors are attributable to this file.","usage":{"total_tokens":62064,"tool_uses":17,"duration_ms":145625},"uuid":"d203877a-30cc-4e70-9722-33b054cbf384","session_id":"e867ece2-5670-426a-953e-de496239b763"}
